---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="MeritBank Services — Eliana Betancur"
  description="A full-stack banking application built by a team. Project managed by Eliana Betancur. UX redesign planned."
>
  <div class="px-6 sm:px-10 pt-8 pb-20">
    <article class="w-full page-reveal">

      <p class="font-mono font-medium text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-rust-700 mb-5 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-rust-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        Project — Product Management · Full Stack
      </p>

      <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.1] mb-6">
        MeritBank Services
      </h1>

      <p class="font-sans text-lg sm:text-xl text-warmgray-600 leading-relaxed mb-12">
        A full-stack banking services application built by a team during the PerScholas certification. I served as project manager, coordinating development across the team and owning delivery. UX redesign is planned.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-16 py-8 border-t border-b border-warmgray-300">
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-warmgray-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Role</p>
          <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 font-medium">Project Manager</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-warmgray-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Context</p>
          <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 font-medium">PerScholas Certification</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-warmgray-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Status</p>
          <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 font-medium">UX redesign planned</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-warmgray-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Stack</p>
          <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 font-medium">Spring Boot, Java, MySQL</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-14">
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-warmgray-800 mb-4">The project</h2>
        <p class="font-sans text-base text-warmgray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          MeritBank Services is a banking application that allows users to manage accounts, make transfers, and view transaction history. Built as a team project during the PerScholas Full Stack Java Developer certification.
        </p>
        <p class="font-sans text-base text-warmgray-600 leading-relaxed">
          My role was project management — coordinating the team, setting priorities, managing the GitHub workflow, and ensuring delivery. This was my first formal experience leading a development team, and it directly shaped how I think about cross-functional collaboration and handoffs.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-14">
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-warmgray-800 mb-6">My contribution</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-warmgray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-rust-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Project management</p>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 leading-relaxed">Coordinated team workflow, managed GitHub branching strategy, ran sprint planning, and owned delivery timeline.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warmgray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-rust-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Team coordination</p>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 leading-relaxed">Facilitated code reviews, managed pull requests, and kept the team aligned across concurrent workstreams.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warmgray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-rust-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Documentation</p>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 leading-relaxed">Maintained project documentation, tracked decisions, and ensured the team had clear requirements before building.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warmgray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-rust-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Full stack contribution</p>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800 leading-relaxed">Contributed to backend and frontend development alongside project management responsibilities.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-warmgray-800 mb-4">UX redesign — coming soon</h2>
        <p class="font-sans text-base text-warmgray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          MeritBank is next in line for a full UX redesign — user research, flows, and a Figma prototype built on Betancur DS. The goal is to demonstrate end-to-end product thinking on a real banking product, from project management through to UX leadership.
        </p>
        <div class="bg-warmgray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-rust-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Planned work</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 font-sans text-sm text-warmgray-800">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 mt-1.5 bg-warmgray-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              UX audit of the existing application
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 mt-1.5 bg-warmgray-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              User research and personas
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 mt-1.5 bg-warmgray-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              Redesigned flows and Figma prototype using Betancur DS
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 mt-1.5 bg-warmgray-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              Frontend rebuild with new design applied
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6 mb-16">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/gneliana/MeritBankServices"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="font-mono text-sm text-rust-700 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-rust-600 transition-colors"
        >
          View on GitHub →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-0">
        <a href="/" class="font-mono text-sm text-warmgray-500 hover:text-warmgray-800 transition-colors">← Back to home</a>
      </div>

    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-reveal {
    animation: rise 0.6s ease-out both;
  }
  @keyframes rise {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .page-reveal { animation: none; }
  }
</style>
